WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:17.950
Hello everyone. Let’s understand how the redemption is going to work, quickly. We have a masculine side, right? This is the masculine side of the State of Israel — which is also the map of Israel, which is what we have in the body. Okay, the right side, surely this one of yours, down to the legs, this whole area from the head.

2
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.650
So think of this as your masculine side.

3
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:21.810
This is our country.

4
00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:23.770
Right? Something is missing.

5
00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:26.330
Right? After all, a Jew is likened

6
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.270
to a diamond.

7
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.150
We are a diamond.

8
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.410
That is the whole will of Hashem.

9
00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.250
Right? Beautiful.

10
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:36.270
So that means the region of Jordan —

11
00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.010
Okay?

12
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.090
Don’t look for logic in the things I’m saying.

13
00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:42.310
Jordan,

14
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:43.990
Israel.

15
00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:47.010
So this is, as it were, what is meant to be ours.

16
00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.310
Now look what a wonder.

17
00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:50.190
This is the feminine side.

18
00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:53.610
Okay? Right now it supposedly isn’t there,

19
00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.910
we don’t see it.

20
00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:58.030
It doesn’t really exist — it is in the subconscious,

21
00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:59.070
it is in concealment.

22
00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:02.290
It is in concealment. The second part of Israel is in concealment.

23
00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:05.910
And this is also the split that everyone says is going to happen, God willing.

24
00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.730
Okay? Now, it isn’t really a split, because you need both sides —

25
00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.990
both the masculine and the feminine; you need them all.

26
00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:12.870
Okay? We’ll talk about that shortly.

27
00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.950
Look at the greatest wonder of all:

28
00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:18.220
the Dead Sea, according to the map of Israel,

29
00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:23.460
is exactly in the middle — it stands between Jordan and Israel, right here.

30
00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:26.580
What do we have here in the human body? The sefira of Tiferet.

31
00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:30.300
Right? The sefira of Tiferet is the sefira of the Holy One, blessed be He;

32
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:34.820
it is what unifies all ten sefirot within us.

33
00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:39.660
Okay? All ten sefirot within us —

34
00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:43.020
the sefira of Tiferet unifies them. And here is the Dead Sea, the Sea of Death:

35
00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.600
out of the darkness, light is born.

36
00:01:44.600 --> 00:02:09.560
Okay? That is why all of Israel is passing through the darkness — from the head, the subconscious — and light enters from Keter. We pass through the darkness, we pass through the darkness in order to… I’ll tell you, the journey began clearly. There was darkness here that broke apart and rose to the head; all the darkness rose, and then light entered. Because in fact, to reach that light, to receive the light — means to pass through all of our traumas, deeper and deeper and deeper.

37
00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:37.490
That is why you are not ill, nothing is happening to you — you are simply going through a journey, all of you together, all of us together. Okay, look what a wonder: so in fact the sefira of Tiferet, from here, came out exactly where the Dead Sea is. That means the redemption will come out from here — Mashiach, the Temple, and so on and so forth. This is our feminine side that is about to open. Okay, and the feminine side — it is known to be in concealment,

38
00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:58.450
it is known that it comes a little from the earth; a woman connects more to the earth. Okay, that is the feminine side. And God willing the split will be that all the people of spirit will be here, and the people of matter will be here. Okay? And that is how we will create a new world: we will supply emotion and health to the material world,

39
00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:25.940
and the material world will supply our needs — the work, the money, all those things. Okay? By way of many, many, many paths that there’s no point going into right now. And that is why there are many disputes in Israel at the moment, two worlds — because we are male and female inside the male. You understand? It’s as if there’s a mess here, because everyone is here, and it needs to synchronize.

40
00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:36.560
And also in general — as the light enters, the feminine energy within us, God willing, and the masculine — they are going to synchronize and become very, very unified already within us.

41
00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:40.100
And that is the redemption, in the shortest of the shortest of the short.

42
00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:44.420
There is much more to talk about. I want to see whether this even interests you;

43
00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:53.120
if so — I’ll do all sorts of other interesting things I received, about all the sefirot, and where Gaza is located, and what is happening here, and so on and so forth.

44
00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.280
That’s it. Have a wonderful day. Bye bye.
